# Decky Loader — the plugin host that gives SteamUI features an in-UI surface (Quick Access
# Menu tab). First consumer: the novadeck-control plugin (apps/decky/novadeck-control), the UI for
# /etc/novadeck/game-tweaks.json and the power profiles — settings that until now were
# ssh-edit-a-json-file only.
#
# The aarch64 asset (PluginLoader-arm64), run natively — NOT the x86_64 `PluginLoader` beside
# it. Native matters beyond speed: everything a plugin backend spawns inherits the loader's
# arch, and under FEX every path a child looked up resolved against the x86 guest rootfs first,
# so host-only tools (a #!/usr/bin/python script, the host lsfg-vk layer) were invisible or ran
# under the guest's interpreter. The asset name differs from `dest` on purpose: the placed file
# keeps the upstream name PluginLoader, which the unit, decky-sync and the guard all key on.
# Decky's self-updater picks the -arm64 asset itself when it runs on aarch64 Linux.
#
# THIS PIN IS THE ONLY PLACE THAT DECIDES THE UPDATE BRANCH. decky-sync seeds no loader.json —
# it used to write {"branch": 1}, on a misreading of what a branch is, corrected in 477acb4 — so
# the loader derives its own branch from the version it runs: "-pre" -> 1, anything else -> 0.
# Ship a stable build and it tracks stable. There is nothing left to keep in agreement by hand.
#
# Why a given version was taken is in that bump's commit message, not here.
#
# mode: PluginLoader is executed directly by plugin_loader.service; without 0755 the unit fails
# with EACCES (kind:file installs 0644 by default — right for the FEX rootfs image, not for a
# binary).
#
# Fields: see packages/inputplumber/prebuilt.pin for the base set and
# packages/fex-rootfs/prebuilt.pin for kind/dest; this pin adds
#   mode -> chmod for the placed file (kind:file only; default 0644)
#
# To bump: pick a release at https://github.com/SteamDeckHomebrew/decky-loader/releases, set
# version + url together, and recompute sha256 from the downloaded asset (upstream publishes no
# checksum sidecar).
name: decky-loader
version: v3.3.0
url: https://github.com/SteamDeckHomebrew/decky-loader/releases/download/v3.3.0/PluginLoader-arm64
sha256: 8ef5dcf36cbbbb6e97201a6baed5d79c4cc44ec27789fc9af1c5b6ae8f0b25b6
kind: file
dest: /usr/share/decky-loader/PluginLoader
mode: 0755
